### 1) Health
GET http://localhost:8000/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 2) Login admin
POST http://localhost:8000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ambulancias.local",
  "senha": "admin123"
}

### Cole o token retornado aqui.
@userToken = COLE_TOKEN_USUARIO

### 3) Criar funcionario
POST http://localhost:8000/api/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nome": "Joao Motorista",
  "email": "joao@empresa.com",
  "senha": "123456",
  "tipo": "funcionario"
}

### 4) Criar dispositivo / ambulancia
### Guarde o device_token retornado.
POST http://localhost:8000/api/dispositivos
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "usuario_id": 2,
  "nome": "Ambulancia 01",
  "identificador": "TAB-AMB-001",
  "placa": "ABC1D23",
  "modelo_veiculo": "Renault Master",
  "quilometragem": 82540
}

@deviceToken = COLE_TOKEN_DISPOSITIVO

### 5) Tablet envia localizacao
POST http://localhost:8000/api/localizacoes
X-Device-Token: {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "latitude": -25.4284000,
  "longitude": -49.2733000,
  "velocidade": 32.5,
  "precisao_gps": 6.8,
  "bateria": 76,
  "quilometragem": 82541.20
}

### 6) Painel
GET http://localhost:8000/api/painel
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 7) Historico do dispositivo 1
GET http://localhost:8000/api/dispositivos/1/localizacoes?limite=100
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Accept: application/json
